  },
  data: {
    LLM: 'Opening trick: Ace of Spades holder leads, everyone contributes one card, and this first trick is always discarded. From second trick onward, leader is highest card of previously led suit. Players must follow led suit if they can. If a player cannot follow and plays another suit (tochoo), trick ends immediately and later players do not play to that trick. Highest card of the led suit picks up all cards played to that interrupted trick and leads next. If everyone follows suit, trick goes to waste and highest led-suit player leads next. Players who empty hand are out, except a player with lead power may need to draw from waste and continue under common rule.',
    Player: 'Opening trick: Ace of Spades holder leads, everyone contributes one card, and this first trick is always discarded. From second trick onward, leader is highest card of previously led suit. Players must follow led suit if they can. If a player cannot follow and plays another suit (tochoo), trick ends immediately and later players do not play to that trick. Highest card of the led suit picks up all cards played to that interrupted trick and leads next. If everyone follows suit, trick goes to waste and highest led-suit player leads next. Players who empty hand are out, except a player with lead power may need to draw from waste and continue under common rule.',
    objective: 'Get away by shedding all cards; last player still holding cards loses.',
    gameplay: 'Opening trick: Ace of Spades holder leads, everyone contributes one card, and this first trick is always discarded. From second trick onward, leader is highest card of previously led suit. Players must follow led suit if they can. If a player cannot follow and plays another suit (tochoo), trick ends immediately and later players do not play to that trick. Highest card of the led suit picks up all cards played to that interrupted trick and leads next. If everyone follows suit, trick goes to waste and highest led-suit player leads next. Players who empty hand are out, except a player with lead power may need to draw from waste and continue under common rule.',
    keyRules: [
      'First trick is a mandatory full trick and always discarded.',
      'From trick two onward, first valid off-suit break immediately stops trick.',
      'Interrupted trick pickup goes to the highest card of led suit, not to the breaker.',
      'Some tables allow taking all cards from immediate-left active player before a trick.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
